AkbasCore 3.1 — SEASC + Compass Foundry — COMPLETE
============================================================================================================
Production Core = Per-Layer Subspace-Fisher Matched-Contrastive Compass + Frozen-Norm Direct Dose + Static Normalized DRA Envelope

Compass equation:
A_L = normalize((C_L + lambda_L I)^(-1) (mu_pos_L - mu_neg_L))

Compass implementation:
Within-class residual geometry + Reduced SVD + Regularized inverse action + FP32 unit normalization

Runtime steering equation:
h'_L = h_L + i0 * E(L) * ||h_L|| * A_L

Separation of responsibilities:
Compass Foundry = direction
SEASC motor      = physical dose
DRA envelope     = static layerwise dose shape

Removed mechanisms:
cosine gain / cap / brake / manifold / radar / JVP / runtime controller = NONE

